== Behavior ==
Bears will [[Creature AI#When avoiding fire|avoid fire]] and run away if they come within 3 meters of a fire source.

Bears can still attack from outside the fire's range but will alter their direction of attack at the last moment, which gives them a chance to miss. To avoid all attacks, the player must run close to the Bear to keep it within the fire's range.

For a [[Torch]], the radius is computed from the fire itself, not from the player's center. Therefore,  it is most effective for the player to face the Bear.

Bears consume [[Blueberries]] on the ground, but they are not [[tameable]]. They do not attack [[Vile]]s despite being in two enemy [[factions]].

== Attacks and abilities ==

=== Bite ===
Lunges forward to bite the player (55 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). This extends 4 meters in a 45-degree horizontal arc and can be used every 4 seconds when within 3 meters of a player.

=== Claws ===
Stands on their hind legs, bounces forward a little, and slams down to attack (50 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] damage). This attack has an arched hitbox 5.5 meters long and 45 degrees across horizontally. It can be used every 4 seconds when within 5 meters of a player.

=== Swipe ===
This attack has three variations, each with its own 4-second cooldown: a swipe with the left claw, a swipe with the right claw, and both swipes chained together (25 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] damage each hit). This attack extends 5.5 meters out in a 45-degree horizontal arc and can be used within 5 meters of a player.

=== Slam ===
Looks very similar to the claw attack, but remains stationary instead of bouncing forward and puts slightly more emphasis on their paws instead of claws (50 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). Unlike the claw attack, this attack hits in a circular area with a radius of 2.5 meters. This can be used every 12 seconds when within 5 meters of a player.

==Note==
* All Bear's attacks have [[Damage#Terrain_damage|tool tier]] 0, which mean they can not be used to harvest resources that require equipment.
* Bears and [[Vile|Viles]] regenerate slightly faster than most creatures, recovering full health over 50 minutes instead of 60.

